1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Hello. This is the HOMEZ V6.5 Quick Start guide.
This video walks you from login to the first dashboard screen.

2
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:25,000
When you launch HOMEZ Desktop,
this login screen appears first.

3
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:40,000
Clicking "English" in the top right
instantly switches the whole screen to English.

4
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:55,000
Enter your username and password,
then press the login button.

5
00:00:55,000 --> 00:01:20,000
After a successful login you see the dashboard:
left navigation, top search/notifications, status cards in the center.

6
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:35,000
The same screen in English looks like this.

7
00:01:35,000 --> 00:02:20,000
The left menu has six groups. Items marked
"Coming soon" are not real features yet.

8
00:02:20,000 --> 00:03:10,000
What you see depends on your role.
Admin-only data is blocked for other roles —
this is intentional security, not a bug.

9
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:30,000
After login, language can only be changed
inside the Settings screen.

10
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:40,000
Next up: Guide 2, Admin Initial Setup.
Thanks for watching.
